  <!-- EN: Reflects a vivid inner world and emotional sensitivity to art and beauty. Imaginative pawns are drawn to things like daydreams, music and art; Realistic pawns are more grounded and practical. -->
  <RPC_Imagination_Tooltip>反映内心世界的丰富程度及对艺术美感的敏感度。衡量个体在现实与幻想之间的倾向。务实型个体专注实际问题，脚踏实地；幻想型个体则常沉浸天马行空的想象，热衷于创造性思维和抽象概念</RPC_Imagination_Tooltip>
  <!-- EN: Captures interest in abstract thinking and complex ideas. Philosophical pawns enjoy deep conversations and philosophical questions; Practical pawns prefer concrete, straightforward thinking. -->
  <RPC_Intellect_Tooltip>体现抽象思维和复杂概念的接受能力。哲思型小人热衷深度讨论与哲学思考；实用型小人偏好具体直接的思维方式。</RPC_Intellect_Tooltip>
  <!-- EN: Describes a drive for novelty, diversity, and exploration. Explorative pawns seek new experiences and challenge norms; Conventional pawns favor routine and familiar settings. -->
  <RPC_Curiosity_Tooltip>描述对新奇事物和探索未知的驱动力。探索型小人追求突破常规的新体验；守成型小人则安于熟悉的日常节奏。</RPC_Curiosity_Tooltip>
  <!-- EN: Describes a drive to achieve long-term goals through hard work and persistence. Industrious pawns are motivated and focused, seeing tasks through to completion; Unmotivated pawns tend to lack drive and may abandon tasks. -->
  <RPC_Industriousness_Tooltip>展现为长期目标持续努力的意志品质。奋进型小人专注执着有始有终；懈怠型小人往往半途而废缺乏恒心。</RPC_Industriousness_Tooltip>
  <!-- EN: Describes a preference for structure, tidiness, and careful planning. Organized pawns manage their environments and tasks with forethought, valuing order and disliking chaos; Disorganized pawns tend to be less structured and may struggle with keeping track of tasks. -->
  <RPC_Orderliness_Tooltip>体现对条理性和计划性的重视程度。条理型小人做事井井有条厌恶混乱；随性型小人常显得杂乱无章丢三落四。</RPC_Orderliness_Tooltip>
  <!-- EN: Describes a commitment to honesty, self-discipline, and moral consistency. Reliable pawns hold themselves to their promises, follow rules, and prioritize doing what's right; Inconsistent pawns may struggle with self-regulation, taking shortcuts or acting unreliably. -->
  <RPC_Integrity_Tooltip>描述恪守承诺与道德准则的可靠程度。可靠型小人言出必行遵纪守法；反复型小人可能投机取巧违背原则。</RPC_Integrity_Tooltip>
  <!-- EN: Reflects a pawn's warmth and engagement in social interactions. Friendly pawns enjoy connecting with others and are approachable; Aloof pawns tend to be more distant and less outwardly social. -->
  <RPC_Sociability_Tooltip>反映社交互动的自然倾向。友善型小人乐于主动交往谈笑风生；孤僻型小人更习惯独处回避社交。</RPC_Sociability_Tooltip>
  <!-- EN: Describes a pawn's tendency to take charge, voice opinions, and influence others in social settings. Assertive pawns are bold and confident speakers; Timid pawns are more reserved and may hesitate to express themselves. -->
  <RPC_Assertiveness_Tooltip>体现表达主张的果断程度。强势型小人敢于直言不讳据理力争；怯懦型小人往往犹豫不决畏首畏尾。</RPC_Assertiveness_Tooltip>
  <!-- EN: Captures a pawn's desire for stimulation, positivity, and activity. Cheerful pawns are energetic, easily excited, and often on the move; Stoic pawns tend to be more reserved in their behavior and less outwardly driven by excitement. -->
  <RPC_Enthusiasm_Tooltip>展现对外界刺激的反应强度。开朗型小人精力充沛情绪外放；坚忍型小人则喜怒不形于色。</RPC_Enthusiasm_Tooltip>
  <!-- EN: Reflects a pawn's capacity for emotional empathy and their desire to alleviate distress in others. Compassionate pawns are kind, nurturing, and emotionally attuned to others' feelings; Detached pawns tend to be less sensitive to the emotional states of those around them. -->
  <RPC_Compassion_Tooltip>衡量体察他人情感的能力。慈悲型小人能感同身受雪中送炭；超然型小人较少受他人情绪影响。</RPC_Compassion_Tooltip>
  <!-- EN: Describes a pawn's preference for peaceful interactions and their willingness to trust. Accommodating pawns avoid arguments, value compromise, and dislike tension; Stubborn pawns may resist compromise and prefer to stick to their own views. -->
  <RPC_Cooperation_Tooltip>描述解决分歧的倾向性。随和型小人善于折中求全；固执型小人坚持己见不肯妥协。</RPC_Cooperation_Tooltip>
  <!-- EN: Captures a pawn's tendency to downplay their own importance and avoid arrogance. Humble pawns are unassuming and respectful, seeing themselves as equals to others; Arrogant pawns tend to exhibit self-importance and may act superior. -->
  <RPC_Humbleness_Tooltip>反映自我评价的谦虚程度。谦逊型小人虚怀若谷平等待人；傲慢型小人容易自视甚高。</RPC_Humbleness_Tooltip>
  <!-- EN: Reflects a pawn's tendency to experience intense, rapidly changing emotions. Volatile pawns struggle with emotional regulation and may exhibit erratic behavior under stress; Stable pawns maintain a more consistent and calm emotional state. -->
  <RPC_Volatility_Tooltip>体现情绪控制的稳定性。多变型小人喜怒无常阴晴不定；稳定型小人情绪平稳处变不惊。</RPC_Volatility_Tooltip>
  <!-- EN: Captures a pawn's predisposition towards negative emotions such as sadness, resentment, and irritability. Pessimistic pawns often feel hopeless and are prone to depressive moods; Optimistic pawns maintain a more positive outlook. -->
  <RPC_Pessimism_Tooltip>描述看待问题的视角倾向。悲观型小人容易聚焦困难消极预期；乐观型小人总是看到积极可能。</RPC_Pessimism_Tooltip>
  <!-- EN: Describes a pawn's susceptibility to feeling overwhelmed and their lack of confidence in stressful situations. Insecure pawns avoid pressure, fear failure, and may withdraw socially; Confident pawns approach challenges with self-assurance and are less affected by judgment. -->
  <RPC_Insecurity_Tooltip>反映面对压力时的心理状态。自卑型小人在挑战前容易自我怀疑；自信型小人则沉着应对游刃有余。</RPC_Insecurity_Tooltip>
